OL,3,GNEWSA'The government says we owe #10k -
OL,4,Abut won't prove it'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA couple have claimed the government is
OL,7,Fcharging them nearly #10,000 for a
OL,8,Fhistorical debt - without proving they
OL,9,Freceived the money in the first place.
OL,11,FBarry Hawker said the Department for
OL,12,FWork and Pensions (DWP) had started
OL,13,Ftaking 20% of his salary - at times
OL,14,Fequivalent to #700 a month - to recover
OL,15,Fan alleged overpaid disability benefit
OL,16,Fbetween 2005 and 2011.
OL,23,APub: 15-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,329,320,200,140,0,100
