OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-$-%%%-!-%%%" ,%-$ -$%%-% ,,
OL,3,GNEWSA'The government says we owe #10k -
OL,4,Abut won't prove it'
OL,5,
OL,6,FBut he claimed he never received the
OL,7,Fmoney and DWP was refusing to say what
OL,8,Fbank account it was paid into. His wife
OL,9,FGemma said they were happy to pay if
OL,10,Fofficials could demonstrate they
OL,11,Factually owed the debt.
OL,13,FThe DWP said: "When recovering an
OL,14,Foverpayment, we carefully receive
OL,15,Favailable records and evidence."
